{"content":[{"c":["HUR"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Aaron’s assistant in supporting Moses’ hands until the Amalekites were defeated at Rephidim (",{"href":"?bref=Exod.17.8-13","r":"Exod.17.8-13","rawR":"Exod.17.8-13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.17.8-13","value":"Exod.17.8-13"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ex 17:8-13"},"). He is mentioned again as assisting Aaron in overseeing Israel while Moses was on Mt Sinai (",{"href":"?bref=Exod.24.14","r":"Exod.24.14","rawR":"Exod.24.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.24.14","value":"Exod.24.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"24:14"},"). According to Josephus, Hur was the husband of Miriam, the sister of Moses (",{"c":["Antiquities"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," 3.2.4)."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Fourth of the five kings of Midian who was killed with Balaam by the Israelites under Moses (",{"href":"?bref=Num.31.8","r":"Num.31.8","rawR":"Num.31.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.31.8","value":"Num.31.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 31:8"},"). He is also referred to as one of the “princes of Midian” and “Sihon” (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.13.21","r":"Josh.13.21","rawR":"Josh.13.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.13.21","value":"Josh.13.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 13:21"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Father of one of the 12 officers whom Solomon appointed to provide food for the king’s household (",{"href":"?bref=1Kgs.4.8","r":"1Kgs.4.8","rawR":"1Kgs.4.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Kgs.4.8","value":"1Kgs.4.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Kgs 4:8"},", ",{"c":["kjv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},"; ",{"c":["nlt"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"}," “Ben-hur”)."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Son of Caleb and Ephrath and the grandfather of Bezalel (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.2.19-20","r":"1Chr.2.19-20","rawR":"1Chr.2.19-20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.2.19-20","value":"1Chr.2.19-20"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 2:19-20"},"; cf. ",{"href":"?bref=Exod.31.2","r":"Exod.31.2","rawR":"Exod.31.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.31.2","value":"Exod.31.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ex 31:2"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Exod.38.22","r":"Exod.38.22","rawR":"Exod.38.22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.38.22","value":"Exod.38.22"}],"t":"ref","v":"38:22"},"). Although some interpreters regard the Hur discussed in #1 as the grandfather of Bezalel, others think that the Hur who assisted Moses and the Hur who was Bezalel’s grandfather were different men."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["5. Father (or perhaps family name) of Rephaiah, a postexilic leader who assisted Nehemiah in rebuilding the Jerusalem wall (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.3.9","r":"Neh.3.9","rawR":"Neh.3.9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.3.9","value":"Neh.3.9"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 3:9"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Hur","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Ex 17:8-13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Exod.17.8-13","rawQueryValue":"Exod.17.8-13","sourceRefExact":"Exod.17.8-13"},{"anchorText":"24:14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Exod.24.14","rawQueryValue":"Exod.24.14","sourceRefExact":"Exod.24.14"},{"anchorText":"Nm 31:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.31.8","rawQueryValue":"Num.31.8","sourceRefExact":"Num.31.8"},{"anchorText":"Jos 13:21","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.13.21","rawQueryValue":"Josh.13.21","sourceRefExact":"Josh.13.21"},{"anchorText":"1 Kgs 4:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Kgs.4.8","rawQueryValue":"1Kgs.4.8","sourceRefExact":"1Kgs.4.8"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 2:19-20","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.2.19-20","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.2.19-20","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.2.19-20"},{"anchorText":"Ex 31:2","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Exod.31.2","rawQueryValue":"Exod.31.2","sourceRefExact":"Exod.31.2"},{"anchorText":"38:22","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Exod.38.22","rawQueryValue":"Exod.38.22","sourceRefExact":"Exod.38.22"},{"anchorText":"Neh 3:9","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.3.9","rawQueryValue":"Neh.3.9","sourceRefExact":"Neh.3.9"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"d819ad9a71d17973ce64eb6b223625a1105c23cad37838c33ea83349a691580b","sourceItemName":"Hur","sourceItemOrder":395,"sourceMember":"Articles/H.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Hur","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Hur","title":"Hur","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}